# oc-sim scenario v1
# The freeze (journal/D-049): launch SUPERSAW as in supersaw.scn, hold the
# right encoder for a second: the panel now edits a copy while SUPERSAW plays
# on. Pick DETUNE and raise it four detents. The snapshot shows the title bar
# in inverse video and DETUNE at 70 % on the copy; SUPERSAW still plays 50 %.
ticks 1500
20  button up down
