70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
130 button down down
140 button down up
150 button down down
160 button down up
170 button down down
176 button down up
190 button right down
196 button right up
250 button right down
1300 button right up
1350 encoder 1 +1
1370 encoder 2 +4
